  title: Pageant Mistake
  headliner: <b>Host Announces Wrong Winner In Historic Pageant</b>
  bodyText: 'Riots almost broke out on live television tonight during the Miss Universe
    broadcast after veteran television host Stephen Hardly accidentally crowned Miss
    Wadiya as the new titleholder instead of the actual winner, Miss Agrabah. '
